      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLIPPERY GYPSY (1) ran fourth on debut then hit the ground running and led throughout to score her maiden win by 3.5 lengths (17.75) at this track. Can make it back-to-back wins. CADILLAC EXPRESS (8) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when second beaten 1.5 lengths (18.05). Well-placed to take this out. SAINT ELLA (4) latest effort finished 4th on August 6 over 400m at this track behind Compton Zirconia beaten 5.5 lengths (23.77) in a TG1-4W. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. SAINT KYLIE (5) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 0.8 lengths third (18.04) in a TG1-4W at this track.",
